+
+/** Optional device curve shaper for a physical auto-brightness mapping. */
+public interface DeviceBrightnessCurvePolicy {
+    /**
+     * Shapes {@code brightness} in place after insertion of the user point at {@code index}.
+     * Returns true when the device policy supplied the complete result. Returning false keeps the
